#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit SDK provides some tools for converting between OpenQASM "
"representations of quantum programs, and the "
"[QuantumCircuit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)"
" class.\n"
msgstr ""
"توفر حزمة Qiskit SDK بعض الأدوات للتحويل بين تمثيلات OpenQASM للبرامج الكمية"
" وفئة "
"[QuantumCircuit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit).\n"

