msgstr "<span id=\"qasm2-import\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Import an OpenQASM 2 program into Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-"
"into-qiskit}"
msgstr ""
"استيراد برنامج OpenQASM 2 إلى Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-into-"
"qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two functions import OpenQASM 2 programs into Qiskit.\n"
"These are [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load), which takes a filename, and [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads), which takes the OpenQASM 2 program as a string.\n"
msgstr ""
"هناك دالتان لاستيراد برامج OpenQASM 2 إلى Qiskit.\n"
"وهما [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load) التي تأخذ اسم ملف، و[`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads) التي تأخذ برنامج OpenQASM 2 كنص (string).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit "
"API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"راجع [واجهة برمجة تطبيقات OpenQASM 2 في "
"Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) لمزيد من المعلومات.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Import simple programs {#import-simple-programs}"
